---
import { site } from '../content/site';
---

<section class="close" aria-labelledby="close-line">
  <div class="close-inner">
    <p class="close-where" data-reveal>I think we'd have a lot of fun building together.</p>
    <p class="close-rights" data-reveal>I've got full working rights and I'd be excited to contribute to the team.</p>
    <p class="close-resume-note" data-reveal>My resume is below if you want the traditional version too.</p>
    <a class="btn-outline" href={site.resumeUrl} data-reveal>Resume</a>

    <div class="close-big">
      <p class="close-mono" data-reveal>three hours for this page</p>
      <h2 class="close-line" id="close-line" data-scale data-threshold="0.4">Imagine a week.</h2>
    </div>

    <a class="btn-pink-lg" id="closeCta" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>Email me<span class="dot dot-ink" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>

    <p class="close-sign" data-reveal>Let's fricking build.</p>
  </div>
</section>
